{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-jer-6-1","title":"Jeremiah 6:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":6,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":6,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 The enemies sent against Judah, 4 encourage themselves. 6 God sets them on work because of their sins. 9 The prophet laments the judgments of God because of their sins. 18 He proclaims God's wrath. 26 He calls the people to mourn for the judgment on their sins.</p>\n<p>O ye. Jos 15:63; 18:21-28; Jud 1:21 gather. 4:29; 10:17,18 blow. 4:5,6,19,20 Tekoa. 2Sa 14:2; 2Ch 11:6; Am 1:1 Bethhaccerem. Ne 3:14 evil. 22; 1:14,15; 4:6; 10:22; 25:9; Eze 26:7-21</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-6-2","title":"Jeremiah 6:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":6,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":6,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>daughter. 4:31; Isa 1:8; 3:16,17; La 2:1,13 comely and delicate woman. or, a woman dwelling at home.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-6-3","title":"Jeremiah 6:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":6,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":6,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>shepherds. Na 3:18 they shall. 4:16,17; 39:1-3; 2Ki 24:2,10-12; 25:1-4; Lu 19:43</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-6-4","title":"Jeremiah 6:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":6,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":6,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>Prepare. 5:10; 51:27,28; Isa 5:26-30; 13:2-5; Joe 3:9 at noon. 15:8; Zep 2:4 for the. 8:20 shadows. So 2:17</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-6-5","title":"Jeremiah 6:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":6,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":6,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>let us destroy. 9:21; 17:27; 52:13; 2Ch 36:19; Ps 48:3; Isa 32:14; Ho 8:14; Am 2:5 Am 3:10,11; Zec 11:1</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-6-7","title":"Jeremiah 6:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":6,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":6,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>a fountain. Pr 4:23; Isa 57:20; Jas 3:10-12 violence. 20:8; Ps 55:9-11; Eze 7:11,23; 22:3-12; 24:7; Mic 2:1,2,8-10 Mic 3:1-3,9-12; 7:2,3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-6-8","title":"Jeremiah 6:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":6,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":6,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>Be thou. 4:14; 7:3-7; 17:23; 31:19; 32:33; 35:13-15; De 32:29; Ps 2:10; 50:17 Ps 94:12; Pr 4:13; Zep 3:7 lest. Eze 23:18; Ho 9:12; Zec 11:8,9 depart. Heb. be loosed, or disjointed. lest I. 2:15; 7:20,34; 9:11; Le 26:34</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-6-9","title":"Jeremiah 6:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":6,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":6,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>They shall. 16:16; 49:9; 52:28-30; Ob 1:5,6; Re 14:18</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-6-10","title":"Jeremiah 6:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":6,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":6,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>To whom. 5:4,5; Isa 28:9-13; 53:1 give. Eze 3:18-21; 33:3,9; Mt 3:7; Col 1:28; Heb 11:7 their ear. 4:4; 7:26; Ex 6:12; De 29:4; Isa 6:9,10; 42:23-25; Ac 7:51,60 the word. 20:8,9; 2Ch 36:15,16; Am 7:10; Lu 11:45; 20:19; Joh 7:7; 9:40 2Ti 4:3 delight. Ps 1:2; 40:8; 119:16,24,35,70,77,174; Ro 7:22</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-6-11","title":"Jeremiah 6:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":6,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":6,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>Therefore. 20:9; Job 32:18,19; Eze 3:14; Mic 3:8; Ac 4:20; 17:16; 18:5 I will. 9:21; 18:21; Re 16:1 for even. Eze 9:6; Lu 17:34</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-6-12","title":"Jeremiah 6:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":6,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":6,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>And their. 8:10; De 28:30-33,39-43; Isa 65:21,22; La 5:3,11; Zep 1:13 I will. 1Ch 21:16; Isa 5:25; 9:12,17,21; 10:4; La 2:4,5,8; 3:3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-6-13","title":"Jeremiah 6:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":6,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":6,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>For. 8:10; 14:18; 22:17; 23:11; Isa 56:9-12; 57:17; Eze 22:12; 33:31 Mic 2:1,2; 3:2,3,5,11; Zep 3:3,4; Lu 16:14; 1Ti 3:3; 2Pe 2:3,14,15 and. 2:8,26; 5:31; 23:11,14,15; 26:7,8; 32:32; Isa 28:7; La 4:13 Eze 22:25-28; Zep 3:4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-6-14","title":"Jeremiah 6:14","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":6,"verseStart":14,"chapterEnd":6,"verseEnd":14},"content":"<p>healed. 8:11,12; Eze 13:10 hurt. Heb. bruise, or breach. 14:17; Isa 1:6; 30:26 Peace. 4:10; 5:12; 14:13; 23:17; 28:3; La 2:14; Eze 13:22; Mic 2:11 2Pe 2:1,18,19</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-6-15","title":"Jeremiah 6:15","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":6,"verseStart":15,"chapterEnd":6,"verseEnd":15},"content":"<p>Were. 3:3; 8:12; Isa 3:9 blush. Eze 2:4; 16:24,25; 24:7; Zep 3:5; Php 3:19 therefore. 23:12; Pr 29:1; Isa 10:4; Eze 14:9,10; Mic 3:6; Mt 15:14 at the time. 5:9,29; Ex 32:34; Eze 7:6-9; Ho 9:7; Mic 7:4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-6-16","title":"Jeremiah 6:16","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":6,"verseStart":16,"chapterEnd":6,"verseEnd":16},"content":"<p>Stand. 18:15; De 32:7; So 1:7,8; Isa 8:20; Mal 4:4; Lu 16:29; Joh 5:39 Joh 5:46,47; Ac 17:11; Ro 4:1-6,12; Heb 6:12; 11:2-40; 12:1 and walk. 7:23; Isa 2:5; 30:21; Joh 12:35; 13:17; Col 2:6 ye shall. Isa 28:12; Mt 11:28,29 We will. 2:25; 18:12; 22:21; 44:16; Mt 21:28-32</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-6-17","title":"Jeremiah 6:17","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":6,"verseStart":17,"chapterEnd":6,"verseEnd":17},"content":"<p>I. 25:4; Isa 21:11; 56:10; Eze 3:17-21; 33:2-9; Hab 2:1; Ac 20:27-31 Heb 13:17 Hearken. Isa 58:1; Ho 8:1; Am 3:6-8 We. Zec 7:11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-6-18","title":"Jeremiah 6:18","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":6,"verseStart":18,"chapterEnd":6,"verseEnd":18},"content":"<p>hear. 4:10; 31:10; De 29:24-28; Ps 50:4-6; Isa 5:3; Mic 6:5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-6-19","title":"Jeremiah 6:19","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":6,"verseStart":19,"chapterEnd":6,"verseEnd":19},"content":"<p>O earth. 22:29; De 4:26; 30:19; 32:1; Isa 1:2; Mic 6:2 even. 4:4; 17:10; Pr 1:24-31; 15:26; Isa 59:7; 66:18; Ho 10:13; Ac 8:22 nor to. 10; 8:9; 1Sa 15:23,26; Pr 28:9; Ho 4:6; Joh 3:19-21; 12:48</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-6-20","title":"Jeremiah 6:20","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":6,"verseStart":20,"chapterEnd":6,"verseEnd":20},"content":"<p>To what. Ps 40:6; 50:7-13,16,17; 66:3; Isa 1:11; 66:3; Eze 20:39; Am 5:21,22 Mic 6:6-8 Sheba. 1Ki 10:1,2,10; Isa 60:6; Eze 27:22 sweet cane. Isa 43:23,24 your burnt. 7:21-23</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-6-21","title":"Jeremiah 6:21","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":6,"verseStart":21,"chapterEnd":6,"verseEnd":21},"content":"<p>I will. 13:16; Isa 8:14; Eze 3:20; Ro 9:33; 11:9; 1Pe 2:8 fathers. 9:21,22; 15:2-9; 16:3-9; 18:21; 19:7-9; 21:7; 2Ch 36:17; Isa 9:14-17 Isa 24:2,3; La 2:20-22; Eze 5:10; 9:5-7</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-6-22","title":"Jeremiah 6:22","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":6,"verseStart":22,"chapterEnd":6,"verseEnd":22},"content":"<p>a people. 1; 1:14,15; 5:15; 10:22; 25:9; 50:41-43</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-6-23","title":"Jeremiah 6:23","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":6,"verseStart":23,"chapterEnd":6,"verseEnd":23},"content":"<p>They shall. 5:16; 50:42; Isa 13:18; Eze 23:22-25; Hab 1:6-10 cruel. 30:14; Isa 13:18; 19:4 their. 4:13; Isa 5:26-30; Lu 21:25,26</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-6-24","title":"Jeremiah 6:24","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":6,"verseStart":24,"chapterEnd":6,"verseEnd":24},"content":"<p>We have. 4:6-9,19-21; Isa 28:19; Eze 21:6,7; Hab 3:16 anguish. 4:31; 13:21; 22:23; 30:6; 49:24; 50:43; Ps 48:6; Pr 1:27,28; Isa 21:3 Mic 4:9,10; 1Th 5:3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-6-25","title":"Jeremiah 6:25","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":6,"verseStart":25,"chapterEnd":6,"verseEnd":25},"content":"<p>Go not. 4:5; 8:14; 14:18; Jud 5:6,7 the sword. 4:10; 20:3,4; *marg: 20:10; 49:29; 2Ch 15:5; Job 18:11; Ps 31:13; Isa 1:20; Lu 19:43</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-6-26","title":"Jeremiah 6:26","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":6,"verseStart":26,"chapterEnd":6,"verseEnd":26},"content":"<p>daughter. 14; 4:11; 8:19,21,22; 9:1; 14:17; Isa 22:4; La 2:11; 3:48; 4:3,6,10 gird. 4:8; 25:33,34; Isa 32:11; Eze 27:30,31; Mic 1:8-10 make thee. 9:1,10,17-22; 13:17; Isa 22:12; La 1:2,16; Eze 7:16-18; Zec 12:10 Lu 7:12; Jas 4:9; 5:1 for the. 4:20; 12:12; 15:8; Isa 30:13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-6-27","title":"Jeremiah 6:27","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":6,"verseStart":27,"chapterEnd":6,"verseEnd":27},"content":"<p>1:18; 15:20; Eze 3:8-10; 20:4; 22:2</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-6-28","title":"Jeremiah 6:28","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":6,"verseStart":28,"chapterEnd":6,"verseEnd":28},"content":"<p>all grievous. 5:23; Isa 1:5; 31:6 walking. 9:4; 18:18; 20:10; Ps 50:20 they are brass. 30; Eze 22:18-22 corrupters. Isa 1:4; Re 11:18; 19:2</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-6-29","title":"Jeremiah 6:29","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":6,"verseStart":29,"chapterEnd":6,"verseEnd":29},"content":"<p>the founder. 9:7; Pr 17:3; Zec 13:9; Mal 3:2,3; 1Pe 1:7; 4:12 in vain. Isa 49:4; Eze 24:13; Ho 11:7</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-6-30","title":"Jeremiah 6:30","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":6,"verseStart":30,"chapterEnd":6,"verseEnd":30},"content":"<p>Reprobate silver. or, Refuse silver. Ps 119:119; Pr 25:4; Isa 1:22,25; Eze 22:18,19; Mt 5:13 the Lord. 14:19; La 5:22; Ho 9:17; Ro 11:1</p>"}]}